---
// Deliberately short. An earlier draft promised pauses, extensions and part
// refunds; none of those exist in the system, and a policy must not describe
// something the studio cannot actually carry out. Expand this once membership
// records can be cancelled, paused or shortened from the admin page.
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
const { refundWindowDays, refundProcessingDays } = site.legal;
---
<Legal
  title="Refunds and cancellation"
  description={`When ${site.name} refunds a membership, and how long the money takes to come back.`}
>
  <p>
    Your first class is free, so you can try the studio before you spend anything. That is the best
    way to be sure it suits you.
  </p>

  <h2>Cancelling</h2>
  <p>
    There is nothing to cancel and no automatic renewal. A membership simply ends on its end date.
    We remind you on WhatsApp before it does, and you renew only if you want to.
  </p>

  <h2>Refunds</h2>
  <p>
    Ask us within {refundWindowDays} days of buying a membership and we will refund it in full, less
    any charge the payment company keeps.
  </p>
  <p>
    After that, memberships are not normally refunded, because a place in a small batch is held for
    you. If something serious changes, an injury, an illness, or a move away from Anjar and Adipur,
    talk to us. We will look at it case by case and do what is fair.
  </p>

  <h2>How to ask</h2>
  <p>
    Message us on <a href={`https://wa.me/${site.whatsapp}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a>,
    write to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>, or speak to the teacher at the studio.
    Tell us your name, your mobile number, and roughly when you paid.
  </p>

  <h2>How long it takes</h2>
  <p>
    We reply within 3 working days. Once a refund is agreed, the money goes back the way you paid it
    and normally reaches you within {refundProcessingDays} working days, depending on your bank.
    Cash is refunded in cash at the studio.
  </p>
</Legal>
